{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp lies in ruins, and dark portals have begun tearing through the world \u2014 unleashing skeletal hordes, goblin raiders, and ancient undead into the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where they came from. No one knows how to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must gather resources, build your shelter, forge uneasy alliances, and descend into cursed dungeons to uncover the truth behind the portals \u2014 and find a way to destroy them before the corruption consumes everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda <strong>Build and expand your shelter</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, fortify your base, and prepare for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/73946809aeb9cf0c41d5b98c6f5097b3.poster.avif?t=1771201860\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/73946809aeb9cf0c41d5b98c6f5097b3.webm?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/73946809aeb9cf0c41d5b98c6f5097b3.mp4?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Explore dark dungeons</strong> \u2013 Venture into caves, ruins, catacombs, and ancient tombs filled with treasures - and nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/fcf91e67ae71f7407cd64029491a3cc0.poster.avif?t=1771201860\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/fcf91e67ae71f7407cd64029491a3cc0.webm?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/fcf91e67ae71f7407cd64029491a3cc0.mp4?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Craft weapons and armor</strong> \u2013 Forge and upgrade powerful gear to take on increasingly deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/268cd6a9d104e0d7e14a970a1a3d59e5.poster.avif?t=1771201860\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/268cd6a9d104e0d7e14a970a1a3d59e5.webm?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/268cd6a9d104e0d7e14a970a1a3d59e5.mp4?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Alchemy and gathering</strong> \u2013 Collect herbs and mushrooms to brew powerful potions, elixirs, and deadly poisons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/7cfbf4d9d7fd1a64fd86054c0e493419.poster.avif?t=1771201860\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/7cfbf4d9d7fd1a64fd86054c0e493419.webm?t=1771201860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai